9. Evidence/ — sanitized configuration extracts, OPC browse/read results, relevant screenshots and evidence index with timestamps and provenance. Include before/after read-only configuration comparison where feasible; report any externally occurring changes separately.
6. Acceptance criteria and stop condition
- Actual endpoint and role of each currently connected OPC server identified or explicitly marked unavailable.
- Site-verified observations for .50, .69 and .70 captured separately from the original design assignments.
- Every enabled live MFCS/UNICORN UDT mapped to its effective source and physical identity status, or explicitly recorded as blocked with reason.
- Room 814 and 815 equipment assignments reconciled individually; no conclusion based solely on connection aliases, hostname, IP or GOOD quality.
- Existing live mappings, UDT definitions, graphics, batch/reporting and historian configuration left unchanged by this commission.
- All proposed corrections traceable to evidence and separated from unresolved questions.
- Report overall execution as COMPLETE, PARTIAL or BLOCKED according to evidence coverage; no claim of completed identity verification where physical evidence is missing.
STOP after producing the review package. Return its path, key findings, count of aligned and unresolved equipment, confirmed cross-room mismatches, and specific decisions needed from Acropolis/TBMC. Do not execute Commission 06D or modify live configuration without separate authorization.
